    "confidence": "high",
    "needsReview": false,
    "note": "No seasonal plumage change; multi-year immature sequence. Gaps: Cape vs White-backed identification at distance remains hard — photos chosen show diagnostic white back or are labelled Gyps africanus by trusted photographers. Most recorded Accipitrid in Kruger GBIF extract. Critically Endangered globally (BirdLife) — conservation status not stored in record fields."
